    {
      "id": "r021",
      "scene": "cone",
      "text": "现在把一滴水，换成一整片雨。能把红光送进你眼睛的水滴，都落在这组方向上。",
      "raw": "research/audio/raw/r021-raw.wav",
      "audio": "public/audio/r021.wav",
      "duration": 6.72,
      "sampleRate": 48000,
      "sha256": "2c8ef057e2e0a30b4a322714eac0e0c8caabf7f0b246042890c62c59c18401fe",
