      "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
      "reference": "D:/python_project/tts/work/clone-reference.wav",
      "subjectiveListeningChecked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "r025",
      "scene": "circle",
      "text": "我们站在地面上，往下看的方向被地面挡住，下面也常常缺少被阳光照到的雨滴。于是只剩天空里的这一段弧。",
      "raw": "research/audio/raw/r025-raw.wav",
      "audio": "public/audio/r025.wav",
      "duration": 9.68,
      "sampleRate": 48000,
      "sha256": "5115c05aec409fcbeecf338ec96e5b772da9fcf83dc9a1513601d71f0fa793c0",
      "rawSHA256": "89b4e9c7b327507afd35f2ad5d3216ec1c7592867ab77583a10a64f02d0485de",
      "version": "V06-protected-broadcast",
      "referenceSHA256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
      "seed": 2254101960,
      "settings": {
        "temperature": 0.42,
        "top_p": 0.86,
        "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
        "non_streaming_mode": true,
        "max_new_tokens": 768
      },
      "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
      "reference": "D:/python_project/tts/work/clone-reference.wav",
      "subjectiveListeningChecked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "r026",
      "scene": "circle",
      "text": "太阳贴近地平线时，圆心也接近地平线，彩虹能露出较长的一段。太阳升高，圆心下沉，露出的弧就短了。",
      "raw": "research/audio/raw/r026-raw.wav",
      "audio": "public/audio/r026.wav",
      "duration": 9.68,
      "sampleRate": 48000,
      "sha256": "428d36da97bd40adfdc46736a8b7272fa08e91f584f2a0443c944f827ed6fc9a",
      "rawSHA256": "8e782fb5682b5f8ae0bf399b65459de46bab0703aae472e4474d480b7e4cac9f",
      "version": "V06-protected-broadcast",
      "referenceSHA256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
      "seed": 1370782205,
      "settings": {
        "temperature": 0.42,
        "top_p": 0.86,
        "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
        "non_streaming_mode": true,
        "max_new_tokens": 768
      },
      "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
      "reference": "D:/python_project/tts/work/clone-reference.wav",
      "subjectiveListeningChecked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "r027",
      "scene": "circle",
      "text": "飞机旁、瀑布上方，有时能看见整圆。条件是脚下也有阳光照亮的水雾，而且视野足够开阔。",
      "raw": "research/audio/raw/r027-raw.wav",
      "audio": "public/audio/r027.wav",
      "duration": 8.24,
      "sampleRate": 48000,
      "sha256": "893f482518a794f3328f9080b2adc4ce1d25ffc81d445be10bb3faec01710c0e",
      "rawSHA256": "fce7d240daef15e791c6b11159022ca55bc0301a3f9d571d09c4bc13caa814c1",
      "version": "V06-protected-broadcast",
      "referenceSHA256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
      "seed": 3218608413,
      "settings": {
