      },
      "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
      "reference": "D:/python_project/tts/work/clone-reference.wav",
      "subjectiveListeningChecked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "r036",
      "scene": "secondary",
      "text": "每次反射，都有一部分光离开原来的路线。多绕一圈，送到眼睛里的光更少，副虹也就显得淡。",
      "raw": "research/audio/raw/r036-raw.wav",
      "audio": "public/audio/r036.wav",
