      },
      "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
      "reference": "D:/python_project/tts/work/clone-reference.wav",
      "subjectiveListeningChecked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "r037",
      "scene": "secondary",
      "text": "两道虹之间，光线比较少集中到那里，所以常有一圈偏暗的天空。这就是亚历山大暗带，天空本身的散射光仍在。",
      "raw": "research/audio/raw/r037-raw.wav",
      "audio": "public/audio/r037.wav",
